# .cursorrules — Resume_maker

Cursor IDE rules. All workspace rules are in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.

- Code style: 2-space TS, 4-space Python, single-quotes TS, double-quotes Python
- No `any`, no backup files, no `.env` writes
- All toolchain, routing, and conventions: see `AGENTS.md` (repo root)
- Multi-file protocol (≥5 files): see `AGENTS.md` canonical block
